{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/touring-exhibition/81","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe: Circling Around Abstraction and Georgia O'Keeffe, Illuminated: Photographs by Tony Vaccaro","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Norton Museum of Art","id":"actor/332","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"The Georgia O'Keeffe Museum presents Georgia O'Keeffe: Circling Around Abstraction  and Georgia O'Keeffe, Illuminated: Photographs by Tony Vaccaro. The first was organized by the Norton Museum of Art under the direction of museum curator Jonathan Stuhlman, who is now at the Mint Museum of Art, while Barbara Buhler Lynes, curator, Georgia O'Keeffe Museum, organized the photography show. \"Circling Around Abstraction,\" features approximately 50 works from various institutional and private collections and is the first exhibition to explore O'Keeffe's consistent use of circular forms during the more than seven decades she was active as an artist.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"Activity"}